{"symbol":"YASHHV","yahoo":"YASHHV.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Yash Highvoltage Ltd.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","website":"https://yashhv.com","about":"Yash Highvoltage Ltd. manufactures and sells high voltage and high current transformer bushings in India and internationally. It also offers transformer bushings, including oil-impregnated paper (OIP) condenser bushings, resin-impregnated paper (RIP) and resin-impregnated synthetic (RIS) condenser bushings, high voltage and high current bushings, OIP wall bushings, and oil-to-oil bushings. The company also provides specialized services, such as repairing, retrofitting, and replacing old bushings, as well as service consulting. Additionally, it offers OIP condenser, RIP/RIS condenser, as well as invests in share capital. The company was incorporated in 2002 and is based in Vadodara, India.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:24:54+00:00","quote":{"price":1105.75,"prevClose":1076.7,"marketCap":3165.27,"high52":1158.95,"low52":366.0,"pe":85.58,"bookValue":64.44,"dividendRate":1.4,"roe":22.53,"shares":2.8626,"insiders":64.32,"institutions":3.55},"prices":{"dates":["2024-12-19","2024-12-20","2024-12-23","2024-12-24","2024-12-26","2024-12-27","2024-12-30","2024-12-31","2025-01-01","2025-01-02","2025-01-03","2025-01-06","2025-01-07","2025-01-08","2025-01-09","2025-01-10","2025-01-13","2025-01-14","2025-01-15","2025-01-16","2025-01-17","2025-01-20","2025-01-21","2025-01-22","2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-0